  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 42c7eb9d65ce3dd408d58e54fe8a4c3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: Night Regulations
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  documentId: night-regulations
  title: Night-shift regulations
  body: 'Keep common areas clear


    Do not leave deliveries or personal items
    in escape routes. Keep stair doors and access panels unobstructed.


    Respect
    quiet hours


    Avoid unnecessary noise between 22:00 and 07:00. Record repeated
    complaints in the shift log.


    Handle keys responsibly


    Building keys
    remain on the security office board when not in use. Return keys after maintenance
    work.


    Electrical and mechanical access


    Only authorized staff may
    enter B1 service rooms. Isolate equipment before carrying out repairs.


    Report
    safety concerns


    Record faults, leaks and damaged fixtures. Use emergency
    services when there is immediate danger.'
